        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th Ay-dhɛk Kɛ Je-kɔb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ guäth ëë ci Ay-dhɛk cu dɔŋ kä cɛ nyinkɛ yäm a ci nëndɛ a mi̱r mi̱r, cuɛ gatdɛ min di̱i̱t ni E-thɔ cɔl, kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Gatdä.” Kä cu gatdɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɣän ɛn gua̱di̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mɔ nɛɛni jɛ mɔ ɛn täämɛ ɣän cä dɔŋ kä kuecä cäŋ li̱ethdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, ji̱n käni yio̱w ka̱kdu kɛnɛ gök dɛɛni daŋädu kä wër käkni ɣä le̱y, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bi jɛ ben thal ni kɛ tha̱t in la go̱r lɔcdä jɛ, kä bi jɛ cu nöŋä, kɛ ɣöö dëë ji̱ poth kam in ŋuɔtdä ta̱a̱ te̱e̱kä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ min ruac Ay-dhɛk kɛ gatdɛ ni E-thɔ liŋ Rɛ-bɛ-ka ruacdiɛn. Kä min ci E-thɔ wä kak kɛ ley, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu Rɛ-bɛ-ka gatdɛ ni Je-kɔb jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä guur liŋ ruacɛ kɛ dämuɔɔr ni E-thɔ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ji̱n wër käkni ɣä le̱y kä biɛ ben tha̱l ɣä kɛ ɣöö dëë ji̱ ben poth nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kam in ŋuɔtdä ta̱a̱ te̱e̱kä.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, gatdä, liŋ ruacdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër rɛy de̱e̱t kä no̱ŋni ɣä dɛy deet da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ ɣöö dëë kɛ cu ben tha̱l guur ni kɛ pe̱k in go̱o̱rɛ kɛ lɔcdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä de̱ri jɛ cu nöŋ mi̱eth kɛ ɣöö dëë guur ji̱ wä poth kam in ŋotdɛ /ke̱nɛ ni li̱w.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Je-kɔb man jiök i̱, “Nɛn ɛ, dämaar ni E-thɔ ɛ ram mi puɔ̱ny mi̱em, kä ɣän puɔth puɔ̱nydä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ kulɛ te i̱di mi wä gua̱a̱r puɔ̱nydä wä thiap, bɛ cu wee mɛɛtä ni jɛ. Inɔ, ɣän bä cu nöŋ ni rɔɔdä kuëth nhiamdɛ a /ci mɔ puɔ̱th.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu man ɛ jiök i̱, “Gatdä, kuëth ɔ bi jek ɔ bɛ te wi̱i̱dä. Kä liŋ ni min la̱tdä ji̱, kä wër nöŋ nikɛ ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cuɛ cu wä, kä cuɛ kɛ wä nöŋ man, kä cu man kɛ thal ni kɛ tha̱t in go̱r lɔc gua̱n ɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ-bɛ-ka bieyni E-thɔ ka̱n, kɛn bieyni tin gɔw ni kɛn pa̱ny tëë cɛ tɔ̱w due̱e̱l kɛ jɛ kɛɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th puɔ̱ɔ̱ny Je-kɔb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ köl dɛɛni de̱e̱t tin kɔŋ par te̱tnikɛ kä cuɛ gua̱a̱th in puɔth ŋuääkdɛ pärikä bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ jɛn, cuɛ mi̱eth in cɛ thal ni kurä kɛnɛ mi la juray cu ka̱m Je-kɔb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ kɛ ka̱m jɛ, cu Je-kɔb kɛ naŋ kä cuɛ gua̱n ben jiök i̱, “Guä,” kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɣän ɛn, gatdä, ɛ ji̱n ŋa gani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Je-kɔb ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈du ni E-thɔ. Cä min ci la̱t ɣä thuk kɛ lätni, ku rɔ jiac nyuur täämɛ, kä bi min cä wä kak cam kɛ ɣöö deri ɣä cu poth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ay-dhɛk gatdɛ thi̱ec i̱, “Ɛ ciɛ ku jek i̱di mɔ ci pɛ̈th inɔ mɔ, gatdä?” Cuɛ gua̱n loc i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial min la Kuothdu jɛ yiëël kɛ nhiamdä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ay-dhɛk Je-kɔb ku jiök i̱, “Bër cɔ̱ɔ̱r, gatdä, kä a ba̱a̱ puɔ̱nydu ben thiap mi ɛ ji̱n gatdä ni E-thɔ ɛpuc.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Je-kɔb wä kä jɛ thiäkä, cu gua̱n ɛ thiap kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱r ce̱t jɔwdu kɛ jɔw Je-kɔb, kä te̱tku kɛ te̱t E-thɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Kenɛ jɛ ŋa̱c kɛ ɣöö te te̱tkɛ kɛ mi̱em ce̱tnikɛ te̱t E-thɔ. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cuɛ jɛ cu poth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min ɛ jɛn i̱ pothɛ jɛ, cuɛ jɛ nyɔk nikɛ thi̱ec i̱, “Ji̱n lapi gatdä ni E-thɔ ɛ puc?” Kä cu Je-kɔb ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ cu jiök i̱, “Ŋun ɛ ɛnɔ ci wä kak ɔ, a jɛ ba̱a̱ ben cam kɛ ɣöö dëë ji̱ cu poth.” Ɛ jɛ nɔ, cuɛ jɛ cu nöŋ jɛ, kä cuɛ mi̱th. Cu gatdɛ jɛ nöŋ kɔaŋ kä cuɛ maath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ ku maath, cuɛ gatdɛ cu jiök i̱, “Ti̱i̱cni rɔ thiäkä, gatdä, bër cim ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cuɛ cu ben thiäkä kä cuɛ jɛ cim. Mëë ci Ay-dhɛk bieyni Je-kɔb ŋuäc, cuɛ jɛ poth wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guäth ëë ci Ay-dhɛk ku thuɔ̱k kɛ puɔ̱th Je-kɔb, kä ɛ niɛ jiɛn Je-kɔb gekä gua̱n, cu däman ni E-thɔ luny jɔk käk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn cuɛ ri̱ŋ lɛni thal ni kɛ jɛn tha̱t in go̱r lɔc gua̱n ɛ, kä cuɛ jɛ nöŋ gua̱n, kä cuɛ jɛ ben jiök i̱, “Jiɛc ni rɔ nyuur, Gua̱a̱thdä, kä bi min cä wä kak cam, kɛ ɣöö deri ɣä cu poth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱n ɛ thi̱ec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n ŋa?” Cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän gatdu ni E-thɔ min la kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈du.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niɛ wa̱nɔ, cuɛ Ay-dhɛk puɔ̱nydɛ lath ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Kä kuɛ la ŋa ɛn ni̱n ci ɣä nöŋ ri̱ŋ lɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ mi cɛ kak? Kä guäth in ti̱i̱ jɔ̱ɔ̱r cä ri̱i̱ŋdɛ cam ni kɛɛliw, cua jɛ cu poth, kä bi puɔ̱th ɛmɔ a duŋdɛ amäni cäŋ kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min ci E-thɔ ruac ɛmɔ liŋ kä gua̱n, cuɛ wak kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t, kä cuɛ gua̱n jiök i̱, “Mal ɣä ni poth bä, gua̱a̱thdä!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min te ni jɛn thi̱n, cu gua̱n ɛ jiök i̱, “Ci dämuɔɔr ɣä ben mɛt kä cɛ puɔ̱thdu ben kual.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɛ mɔ, cu E-thɔ ɛ cu jiök i̱, “Ca jɛ ku cɔal ni guäthdɛ ɛpuc ni Je-kɔb, ɛ nɛ cɛ ɣä loc kɛ mët ni kä rɛɛwɛ, ɛ jɛn cɛ gua̱a̱th di̱tädä kɔŋ wen kä täämɛ cɛ puɔ̱thdä lɛni ben kual.” Kä cuɛ gua̱n lɛni thi̱ec i̱, “Ji̱n, /cɛ cu thil puɔ̱th mi ci mal duɔ̱th ɣä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ay-dhɛk ɛ loc i̱, “Cä jɛ jak kä kuääru, kä cä dämani diaal jak kä kuaanykɛ, kä cä jɛ puɔ̱th bɛl ti ŋuan. Ɣän bä ji̱ kulɛ lät kä ŋu, gatdä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu E-thɔ ɛ jiök i̱, “Ci nɔmɔ cua̱ niɛ jɛn pe̱k puthädu a thil dɔ̱diɛn? Poth ɣä bä, gua̱a̱thdä.” Kä cuɛ pa̱r kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wä Je-kɔb kä närɛ ni La-ban",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu E-thɔ däman ni Je-kɔb cu luɔ̱c tɛr kɛ kui̱ puthä min ci gua̱n ɛ ka̱m jɛ, kä cuɛ riet kɛ lɔcdɛ i̱, “Kɛn ni̱n tin ba par ni gua̱a̱r cikɛ thiak. Bä rɔ cu jek gua̱a̱th mi na̱kä ni dämaar ni Je-kɔb.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Rɛ-bɛ-ka ca̱p gatdɛ min cɛ lat liŋ kä naath, ɛ jɛn cuɛ gatdɛ ni Je-kɔb cɔl kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Dämuɔɔr bi̱i̱mɛ näkdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liŋ min la̱tdä ji̱, gatdä. Ji̱n bar rɔ niɛ täämɛ kä wër kä dämaar ni La-ban ro̱o̱l Ɣa-ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër teni kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kɛ ni̱n ti tɔt, amäni mi wä waŋ lɔaac dämuɔɔr wä thuɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr kä mi, wëë min ci lät kä jɛ wä pa̱l rueec, bä ji̱ jäk kä raan kä bi̱i̱ ciööl jɔk. /Ciɛ luɔt ɛn ɣöö dërɛ bath nhiamdä kɛ cäŋ kɛl yɛn da̱ŋ rɛw ni kɛɛl.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
